    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`DeepseekV2AttentionMLA.q_b_proj_forward` routes `1 <= M <= 16` rows to the min-latency `dsv3_fused_a_gemm` kernel for verified `q_b_proj` shapes (`(2048, 2048)` and `(4096, 2048)`) and `M > 16` rows to `self.q_b_proj` (regular linear). Because the two kernels round differently (observed 1-ULP BF16 differences across `M = 16`), a token's `q` projection and output logprobs depend on how many tokens share the forward pass (decode at `bs <= 16` vs. `bs > 16`, or decode vs. prefill). `prepare_qkv_latent` already disables its min-latency fused QKV-A GEMM under `--enable-deterministic-inference`; `q_b_proj_forward` was missing the same guard.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Guard `self._use_min_latency_q_b_gemm` in `DeepseekV2AttentionMLA.q_b_proj_forward` with `not get_exec().deterministic.enable_deterministic_inference`.\n- Add hermetic CPU unit tests in `test/registered/unit/models/test_deepseek_q_b_proj_deterministic.py`.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Code Formatting with Pre-Commit](https://docs.sglang.ai/references/contribution_guide.html#code-formatting-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests as outlined in the [Running Unit Tests](https://docs.sglang.ai/references/contribution_guide.html#running-unit-tests-adding-to-ci).\n- [ ] Update documentation / docstrings / example tutorials as needed, according to [Writing Documentation](https://docs.sglang.ai/references/contribution_guide.html#writing-documentation-running-docs-ci).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41718843696](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41718843696)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41718843616](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41718843616)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41718843549](https://github.com/sgl-